      "id": "txt_detr",
      "x": 635,
      "y": 426,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 98,
      "text": "detrend()\n÷ distance-decay curve P(s)\nO/E ≈ 1 ⇒ “normal for that separation”\nO/E > 1 ⇒ genuine 3D enrichment\n(stops the model learning “near things touch”)",
